The directory corrected_data supplies the file-level corrections established in the
accompanying paper: Line22gps.g contains the 80 row-22 classes; Line19gpsp.g and
Line19gpsm.g contain the records whose prescribed subgroups match the file type,
with the two dual-type classes listed in both files; Line1gpsp.g carries the corrected
plus-type name with unchanged records.  Every removed record is conjugate to a record
that remains, by the stored matrices verified above.
